N D 0~
amnizu pudgy devil~
&03an amnizu devil&00~
&03A pudgy devil with leathery wings glides about searching for enemies.&00
~
This short pudgy devil is a horror to gaze upon despite its
small stature, for it emits an aura of confidence and power. Its
body is only four feet tall, bald and wrinkled, but sprouts a pair
of large leathery wings which can propell it quickly through the
air. Large black eyes gaze seemingly into your very soul as its
razor sharp teeth chatter in fury at your presence near the hells.
It is sworn to defend the passages of the River Styx and suddenly
its telepathic voice tells you of your impending doom at its hands.
~
