abishai devil reptilian red~
&01a red abishai devil&00~
&01A reptilian devil, deep red in color, flies about the rocky tunnel.&00
~
This devil is colored the deep red of blood, making it look
more fiendish than its six foot length would initially indicate.
A pair of powerful wings sprout from the reptilian creature's back,
carrying it quickly through the midnight air above the Styx. With a
blood curdling scream of rage the creature attacks with claw and
bite to torment the lesser creatures unfortunate enough to cross
its path.
~
