This fiendish looking devil stares out across the jagged rocks and
niches with a fearsome gaze, its slanted eyes searching for creatures to
mame and torment. Colored the midnight blue of the evening sky, this
creature is reminescient of the gargoyles of myth and legend, for it
sports powerful wings, a fanged maw and sharp claws. Occasionally, it lets
loose a chilling scream of rage as it arches its serpentine tail and
assesses its surroundings.
~
