abishai devil reptilian white~
&14a white abishai devil&00~
&14A reptilian devil, colored a snowy white is silhoueted against the rocks.&00
~
Against the pitch black rocks surrounding the river, this creature
certainly stands out for it is colored a dull, snowy white. Reptilian in
form, this devil has a pair of huge leathery wings and a scaly
prehensile tail which is tipped with a barbed stinger. Razor sharp claws
and a similar set of fangs make the creature look quite viscious and
deadly in combat, probably a service it provides willingly to its fiendish
masters.
~
