This huge shape appears to be made of substantial shadow matter, weaved
into a gruesome form some ten feet in diameter. Flailing tentacles of
the shadow-stuff reach out to grasp at prey and tear it to shreds. No
eyes or mouth are evident in the deep black which is this creature, but
you know it senses your presence..
~
