charon boatman~
&07Charon the Boatman&00~
&07Charon, the Boatman of the Lower Planes, observes you silently.&00
~
Charon appears as a skeletal man, with a haggard face and eyes which
glow with an all-seeing red light. He is dressed in fine black robes of
ermine and silk, which flow out behind him in an unfelt breeze. In his
bony hands lies a runed staff with which he mans his skiff through the
lower planes of the Realms.
~
