&07A charonadaemon&00~
&07A pale grey skeletal figure silently mans a small skiff along the river.&00
~
  You see before you a thin skeletal figure covered in tightly stretched
pale-grey skin. Its eyes are of a similar greyish color, seemingly blank
and void of feeling. Over the bony frame the figure wears drab robes of
somber black and grey which hang stiffly from its shoulders, rasping ever
so slightly as the fabric rubs together.
~
