N D 0~
daemon hydrodaemon hydro amphibian creature~
&09a hydrodaemon&00~
&09A strange amphibious creature swims in the river waters.&00
~
   This strange creature looks much like a demon-frog hybrid and is as
loathsome as both. Its greenish skin is splattered with patches of scales,
clumps of blackish moss, and hideous scars and welts. Slime oozes from the
welts and trickles down the daemon's form, soaking its webbed-claws and
underbelly skin flaps. It appears that despite its gruesome appearance, the
creature would be an excellent swimmer and glider, highly manuverable in its
chosen environment, although it will occasionally leave the river to lie
about the rocky river banks.
~
